WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.845
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:10.115 --> 00:11.449
[theme music playing]

3
00:28.925 --> 00:30.051
TAKE CHARGE OF MY HEART

4
00:31.136 --> 00:33.429
[curious music playing]

5
00:37.308 --> 00:38.184
[Ho-rang gasps]

6
00:42.522 --> 00:44.274
Oh, no, uh, this isn't what it looks like.

7
00:44.357 --> 00:46.651
-I, um… -Ah! Ah…

8
00:48.778 --> 00:49.988
-Huh… -[Bo-bae] No, wait!

9
00:50.071 --> 00:51.447
[pained gasping]

10
00:52.031 --> 00:54.909
I swear it's not what it looks like. I… I wasn't…

11
00:55.618 --> 00:56.953
I wasn't trying to kiss you.

12
00:57.036 --> 00:59.914
I just woke up, and I was here, and you were right there, and I, uh…

13
00:59.998 --> 01:01.207
Okay…

14
01:02.000 --> 01:03.960
-Get out. -Wait! Hang on.

15
01:04.752 --> 01:05.837
Please…

16
01:06.462 --> 01:09.299
So when I do this… Nothing.

17
01:09.382 --> 01:11.342
See? Usually, there's a shock.

18
01:12.218 --> 01:13.970
It doesn't affect you at all? You don't feel…

19
01:14.053 --> 01:15.889
-[Ho-rang grunts] -Ah-ah!

20
01:15.972 --> 01:18.850
I already told you. I really don't like being flirted with like this…

21
01:18.933 --> 01:20.810
-Flirted with? -[whimsical music playing]

22
01:20.894 --> 01:23.104
[chuckling] Listen.

23
01:23.605 --> 01:27.984
I know it sounds like I'm trying to seduce you, but I swear it's not! [sighs]

24
01:28.067 --> 01:30.320
Gosh, you didn't even bother hearing me out.

25
01:31.029 --> 01:33.573
And all I've tried to do is explain this whole time…

26
01:33.656 --> 01:35.491
Go, or I'm calling the cops.

27
01:35.575 --> 01:36.618
Just hang on!

28
01:37.619 --> 01:40.914
Look! I had my appendix removed, okay?

29
01:40.997 --> 01:42.332
This is my hospital room.

30
01:42.415 --> 01:45.835
This is a single-patient room for VIPs. They always give me this one.

31
01:45.919 --> 01:49.172
[gasping pointedly] Then why are there two beds?

32
01:49.255 --> 01:51.049
I just opened my eyes and I was in here.

33
01:51.132 --> 01:52.592
And I don't care. Now get out.

34
01:52.675 --> 01:54.969
-[door opens] -[Dr. Jang] Na Bo-bae is right.

35
01:55.053 --> 01:56.012
[door closes]

36
01:57.722 --> 01:58.598
You're sharing.

37
01:58.681 --> 01:59.641
Hello, Doctor.

38
02:00.350 --> 02:01.517
Oh dear.

39
02:03.686 --> 02:06.898
-Hm. -[Ho-rang] Let me get this straight.

40
02:07.482 --> 02:09.400
You're saying the hospital had a blackout,

41
02:09.484 --> 02:12.403
which is when my artificial heart malfunctioned?

42
02:12.904 --> 02:17.116
[Dr. Jang] This smart watch displays the remaining charge left on your heart.

43
02:19.118 --> 02:22.497
Normally, it displays a full charge of 100%.

44
02:22.580 --> 02:23.665
However, now

45
02:23.748 --> 02:25.959
it's dropped to 43%.

46
02:26.042 --> 02:27.877
Then we'll replace it. We can do that.

47
02:27.961 --> 02:30.463
-You could have more surgery, of course. -Good.

48
02:30.546 --> 02:32.340
In about three months.

49
02:33.383 --> 02:37.303
It's too risky to attempt a repeat surgery so soon when you need to recover.

50
02:37.387 --> 02:39.180
The stress on your body could prove fatal.

51
02:39.264 --> 02:41.474
And even if everything went smoothly,

52
02:42.058 --> 02:43.726
you would need extensive rest.

53
02:43.810 --> 02:46.771
-Full recovery would take at least a year. -That long?

54
02:48.690 --> 02:51.234
But I… That's impossible. I can't wait that long.

55
02:51.985 --> 02:53.945
[Dr. Jang] So, for the time being,

56
02:55.238 --> 02:57.323
your roommate is going to assist us.

57
02:57.865 --> 02:59.367
-What? -What?

58
03:00.285 --> 03:02.287
Me? How am I supposed to assist?

59
03:02.370 --> 03:03.955
I'm at a loss to explain how,

60
03:04.038 --> 03:06.958
but when you're around, Miss Bo-bae, it's quite remarkable.

61
03:07.041 --> 03:09.419
Your heart battery gradually recharges.

62
03:09.502 --> 03:10.712
[electricity fizzing]

63
03:13.298 --> 03:18.469
This patient, Na Bo-bae, claims she made the power come back on?

64
03:18.553 --> 03:19.512
Yes.

65
03:20.013 --> 03:22.974
At first I assumed she was simply nervous before her surgery,

66
03:23.057 --> 03:24.809
but while we were rolling her down the hall,

67
03:24.892 --> 03:26.352
the lights there started to flicker.

68
03:26.436 --> 03:27.562
And, Doctor, look…

69
03:29.647 --> 03:31.524
-[crackling] -[nurse gasps] Uh…

70
03:32.400 --> 03:36.070
Her skin, it… it gives off unusually high levels of static electricity.

71
03:37.238 --> 03:38.364
[watch beeps]

72
03:38.448 --> 03:41.993
Doctor, it looks like his heart's starting to recharge.

73
03:42.493 --> 03:45.079
But his heart battery was originally at 6%.

74
03:45.163 --> 03:46.706
[suspenseful music building]

75
03:48.750 --> 03:50.585
-[music stops] -Wait, this is…

76
03:51.252 --> 03:52.670
[intriguing music playing]

77
03:54.047 --> 03:55.173
[sparks fizzing]

78
03:59.594 --> 04:02.805
[Dr. Jang] When you're within a ten-meter radius of Miss Bo-bae,

79
04:02.889 --> 04:06.267
your heart battery charges up, little by little.

80
04:13.775 --> 04:14.776
[music fades]

81
04:15.693 --> 04:17.111
-[Dr. Jang grunts] -Goodbye.

82
04:17.195 --> 04:20.156
Oh no. Wait. Hey, watch out for my stomach. I don't feel good…

83
04:20.698 --> 04:22.825
You expect me to believe a story like that?

84
04:23.618 --> 04:24.827
Seriously.

85
04:24.911 --> 04:26.746
-Ho-rang, wait! -[door closes]

86
04:27.288 --> 04:30.625
Jeez, why would he just throw me out like that?

87
04:31.751 --> 04:32.752
[Dr. Jang] Look…

88
04:33.294 --> 04:34.712
Ho-rang's on edge.

89
04:34.796 --> 04:38.925
This is his life we're talking about. I don't blame him for not believing me.

90
04:39.425 --> 04:42.637
To tell you the truth, I barely believe it myself.

91
04:42.720 --> 04:45.848
But despite all that, I'm convinced that you are his lifeline.

92
04:45.932 --> 04:49.352
How? You heard him, he doesn't want my help.

93
04:49.977 --> 04:54.315
Besides, I don't feel like a lifeline. I feel like a piece of string.

94
04:54.399 --> 04:57.193
You must have noticed there's something weird about me.

95
04:57.276 --> 04:59.821
Something unusual? How can I help anyone?

96
04:59.904 --> 05:03.825
Well, we'd have to conduct some more tests to gather more data,

97
05:03.908 --> 05:06.702
but… but yes, you are unusual.

98
05:06.786 --> 05:10.248
You know, unusual people can do the most extraordinary things.

99
05:10.331 --> 05:14.168
Don't be so hard on the piece of string. I bet it can help more than it thinks.

100
05:15.086 --> 05:17.130
-[pensive music playing] -[Dr. Jang] Hm.

101
05:20.341 --> 05:21.467
[Ho-rang sighs]

102
05:23.803 --> 05:25.263
Will you be all right, sir?

103
05:25.346 --> 05:27.640
Perhaps we should call that woman back to recharge.

104
05:27.723 --> 05:29.684
[Ho-rang] Don't tell me you believe that.

105
05:29.767 --> 05:32.103
How can a human recharge an artificial heart?

106
05:32.603 --> 05:33.604
Three months…

107
05:34.105 --> 05:36.274
Three months until another surgery?

108
05:37.483 --> 05:39.277
What will my grandmother say?

109
05:39.360 --> 05:42.280
And my aunt and Choi Do-yoon are just waiting to take me down.

110
05:42.363 --> 05:45.825
Plus there's the 30th anniversary, but I still have to sign Ji Eun-ho…

111
05:45.908 --> 05:47.743
Deep breaths. Breathe, sir.

112
05:48.244 --> 05:49.871
We can reschedule if we have to.

113
05:49.954 --> 05:51.956
-What do we do if we can't sign-- -I'll handle it.

114
05:52.039 --> 05:54.333
I'm gonna make sure to cover every possibility.

115
05:54.417 --> 05:55.376
[inhales deeply]

116
05:55.460 --> 05:56.627
Deep breaths…

117
05:56.711 --> 05:57.670
[exhales slowly]

118
05:57.753 --> 05:58.838
[exhales slowly]

119
06:00.256 --> 06:01.466
Have a seat, sir.

120
06:01.549 --> 06:03.718
[Ho-rang grunting nervously]

121
06:04.677 --> 06:06.304
-[sighs] -[shoes fall to floor]

122
06:06.971 --> 06:08.014
[spray spritzes]

123
06:08.097 --> 06:10.641
-[calming music playing] -[Ho-rang inhales deeply]

124
06:11.517 --> 06:12.602
[exhales slowly]

125
06:16.272 --> 06:17.732
-[sighs] -[music stops]

126
06:17.815 --> 06:19.775
Hey, look, only 1% down!

127
06:19.859 --> 06:21.652
You sure you'll be all right?

128
06:25.072 --> 06:25.948
Oh…

129
06:27.283 --> 06:30.161
Of course. You should really be getting back.

130
06:31.245 --> 06:33.831
I should, sir. Call me if you need anything else.

131
06:33.915 --> 06:35.833
Don't let yourself spiral. Try to meditate.

132
06:35.917 --> 06:38.753
Anxiety and stress will impede your recovery.

133
06:38.836 --> 06:41.339
Do your best to clear your thoughts, sir.

134
06:47.178 --> 06:49.222
-[door opens, closes] -[breathing deeply]

135
06:49.305 --> 06:51.057
[calming music resumes]

136
06:51.682 --> 06:53.059
-[sighs] -[watch chimes]

137
06:53.142 --> 06:54.435
[sighs]

138
07:00.107 --> 07:01.275
[groans softly]

139
07:05.863 --> 07:08.824
[Dr. Jang] Unusual people can do the most extraordinary things.

140
07:08.908 --> 07:13.120
Don't be so hard on the piece of string. I bet it can help more than it thinks.

141
07:14.413 --> 07:16.832
So he has a device in his chest

142
07:17.333 --> 07:20.044
which is absorbing the current coming from me?

143
07:29.929 --> 07:31.389
-[scoffs] -[watch chimes]

144
07:33.849 --> 07:35.476
[intriguing music playing]

145
07:43.693 --> 07:44.777
[Ho-rang sighs]

146
07:47.405 --> 07:50.491
What? You kicked me out and now you wanna talk?

147
07:50.575 --> 07:52.201
Feels a bit desperate, honestly.

148
07:52.285 --> 07:53.661
Can I please just

149
07:54.328 --> 07:55.788
borrow you for a minute?

150
08:07.466 --> 08:08.884
[music ends with a flourish]

151
08:09.385 --> 08:10.678
[Ho-rang sighs]

152
08:18.185 --> 08:19.854
[curious music playing]

153
08:25.234 --> 08:27.945
Ooh, excuse me. What do you think you're doing?

154
08:28.029 --> 08:29.822
Must be a microchip in there or something…

155
08:29.905 --> 08:32.158
-Eyes up here, buddy! -[slide whistle plays]

156
08:32.241 --> 08:34.243
[sighs] If it's not a chip,

157
08:34.952 --> 08:36.120
what did you do to me?

158
08:36.787 --> 08:37.705
Are you magic?

159
08:37.788 --> 08:39.081
I'm not a witch!

160
08:39.165 --> 08:42.251
I woke up from my surgery and I was next to you. That's it!

161
08:42.335 --> 08:45.588
All right, fine. We'll just have to chalk it up to a miracle.

162
08:46.422 --> 08:49.133
My surgery's in three months. I need you with me 'till then.

163
08:49.216 --> 08:51.469
For the time being, anyway. Till I have another option.

164
08:51.552 --> 08:54.180
Is that your way of asking? You're bossing me around.

165
08:54.263 --> 08:55.097
[scoffs]

166
08:56.182 --> 08:57.850
-[laughs] -You are.

167
08:57.933 --> 09:00.936
[scoffs] All right, I'll give you what you want.

168
09:01.020 --> 09:02.438
Wait, what do I want?

169
09:02.521 --> 09:03.689
[Ho-rang groans softly]

170
09:06.150 --> 09:07.443
[sighs]

171
09:14.825 --> 09:16.744
[romantic music playing]

172
09:17.703 --> 09:18.704
[Bo-bae] Sorry.

173
09:19.205 --> 09:21.624
Do you think we could give it one more go?

174
09:21.707 --> 09:23.417
[romantic music builds]

175
09:23.501 --> 09:24.919
[suspenseful music playing]

176
09:29.465 --> 09:30.591
Whoa!

177
09:30.675 --> 09:32.218
[whimsical music playing]

178
09:32.301 --> 09:34.428
-What are you doing? -What do you mean?

179
09:34.512 --> 09:36.931
This is what you've wanted ever since we met!

180
09:37.014 --> 09:38.557
You obviously wanted to kiss me.

181
09:38.641 --> 09:39.600
That wasn't what I…

182
09:40.935 --> 09:41.977
That was just…

183
09:42.561 --> 09:44.980
I just needed to check something… [clears throat]

184
09:45.064 --> 09:47.733
I don't need to check anything anymore, so we're good.

185
09:47.817 --> 09:50.277
You have an artificial heart. That's what I felt.

186
09:50.361 --> 09:51.862
That's all I felt, right?

187
09:53.447 --> 09:54.824
[clears throat] Oh.

188
09:55.700 --> 09:58.369
So, what do you want in exchange?

189
09:58.452 --> 09:59.412
Money?

190
09:59.912 --> 10:01.038
Money's easy for me.

191
10:02.415 --> 10:03.416
Name your price.

192
10:04.125 --> 10:06.919
[snickering]

193
10:08.546 --> 10:10.089
[sighs] What a guy.

194
10:10.756 --> 10:14.385
When you didn't know what I wanted, you jumped straight to kissing, wow.

195
10:14.468 --> 10:16.804
And then you bragged about how much money you could give me,

196
10:16.887 --> 10:18.514
like it was some kind of charity case.

197
10:18.597 --> 10:20.224
All you've done from the start is assume.

198
10:20.307 --> 10:23.185
You could've asked why I followed you after we kissed.

199
10:23.269 --> 10:25.229
Or why I wanted to know if you felt a spark.

200
10:25.312 --> 10:26.689
You should've asked!

201
10:27.606 --> 10:29.191
I wish you'd just asked.

202
10:33.320 --> 10:36.824
Whatever. I guess your battery charges when I'm around, so fine, I'll help.

203
10:36.907 --> 10:41.036
I don't want you to die or anything. And that's it. That's all you get.

204
10:41.787 --> 10:44.749
I don't wanna to be any closer to you than I have to.

205
10:50.254 --> 10:51.672
[sighs] Great…

206
10:52.173 --> 10:53.090
[watch chimes]

207
10:56.594 --> 10:58.262
[intriguing music playing]

208
11:00.556 --> 11:01.599
[watch bongs]

209
11:03.851 --> 11:05.644
-[Bo-bae gasps] -[watch chimes]

210
11:05.728 --> 11:08.814
Hey, what do you think you're doing? Didn't you hear what I told you?

211
11:08.898 --> 11:10.357
[Ho-rang breaths rapidly]

212
11:10.441 --> 11:13.110
What? Oh. Hey, let go. Cut it out.

213
11:13.194 --> 11:14.779
You little… [gasps]

214
11:14.862 --> 11:16.906
I got a black belt in tae kwon do, you know?

215
11:16.989 --> 11:19.658
My sister's a tae kwon do gold medalist. She retired, but…

216
11:19.742 --> 11:20.743
My brother does judo and--

217
11:20.826 --> 11:21.827
Whoa.

218
11:22.995 --> 11:24.622
[intriguing music playing]

219
11:29.418 --> 11:31.128
I just need to check something.

220
11:31.879 --> 11:33.130
-[sighs] -[watch chimes]

221
11:37.343 --> 11:39.220
What? I can't believe this!

222
11:39.303 --> 11:40.638
-[grunts] -[pained groan]

223
11:41.347 --> 11:43.349
Ah! Ow, my heart.

224
11:43.432 --> 11:45.476
You were just trying to cop a feel? Tsk!

225
11:45.559 --> 11:47.061
No…

226
11:47.144 --> 11:48.395
Ah… ah.

227
11:49.146 --> 11:50.231
[Ho-rang groans]

228
11:50.314 --> 11:53.400
[breathing heavily]

229
11:59.073 --> 12:00.282
It worked.

230
12:01.534 --> 12:02.827
How could it?

231
12:03.536 --> 12:06.455
[Dr. Jang] Studies have been conducted on the phenomenon.

232
12:06.539 --> 12:08.958
Though nothing's been proven, so I can't say for sure.

233
12:09.834 --> 12:11.794
But the fact remains,

234
12:12.378 --> 12:16.799
when you're both within a certain distance of each other, your battery charges up.

235
12:16.882 --> 12:19.718
If you're within ten meters or closer, the faster it charges.

236
12:19.802 --> 12:21.053
Yeah! Uh…

237
12:21.136 --> 12:23.222
Yeah, I know. So,

238
12:24.640 --> 12:26.225
If this is us

239
12:26.976 --> 12:28.310
then that means

240
12:28.894 --> 12:30.729
we have to get even closer?

241
12:31.397 --> 12:33.357
You mean we have to get physical?

242
12:33.440 --> 12:34.525
[Dr. Jang] Well,

243
12:34.608 --> 12:38.320
it would seem you're more likely to be charged by her

244
12:38.404 --> 12:40.865
if your mucosae were to be touching.

245
12:41.448 --> 12:42.658
My…

246
12:42.741 --> 12:43.909
What?

247
12:44.827 --> 12:46.829
[mysterious music playing]

248
13:13.063 --> 13:15.441
-[triumphant music playing] -[applause]

249
13:16.066 --> 13:17.318
[gasps]

250
13:18.485 --> 13:19.445
Ugh…

251
13:20.112 --> 13:21.780
No, I refuse! [gasps softly]

252
13:22.656 --> 13:24.950
Um… Are you good?

253
13:25.034 --> 13:26.285
So you're saying

254
13:26.785 --> 13:29.413
that I have to touch that woman?

255
13:30.706 --> 13:31.624
[sighs]

256
13:32.166 --> 13:33.834
And if I don't, then I'll die?

257
13:34.335 --> 13:38.047
[photographer] Just like the test shoot. Look straight ahead. Keep it natural.

258
13:38.130 --> 13:39.590
Great! Yeah, hold that pose.

259
13:39.673 --> 13:42.092
Eyes to the camera, good. This is really working.

260
13:42.176 --> 13:44.803
Na-min, let's get you moving a little closer to Eun-ho.

261
13:44.887 --> 13:47.431
Okay, now really gaze into each other's eyes.

262
13:47.514 --> 13:49.224
Yes, perfect! Very nice.

263
13:49.308 --> 13:51.602
Hold it there. Turn to face the camera. Beautiful.

264
13:51.685 --> 13:55.064
Hold that pose. We'll take a few more. Yeah, that's great.

265
13:55.981 --> 13:58.859
The camera loves you. Keep it up. Keep it up!

266
13:59.360 --> 14:00.819
Cross one leg over the other.

267
14:00.903 --> 14:04.114
Yeah, this is great. I love it. Very, very suave.

268
14:04.198 --> 14:07.326
Okay, here we go! That expression is perfect.

269
14:07.409 --> 14:11.956
Now tilt your head slightly. Nice. Really nice. Hold it there. Yes!

270
14:13.457 --> 14:15.250
[camera shutter clicking]

271
14:15.334 --> 14:17.544
Hey, do I have anything else booked today?

272
14:17.628 --> 14:20.422
You have the overnight shoot. You're not going anywhere.

273
14:20.506 --> 14:22.466
-[Eun-ho sighs] -Hello, Mr. Ji Eun-ho.

274
14:28.472 --> 14:30.516
Oh, I'll take that for you, thanks.

275
14:32.434 --> 14:34.478
Hanlim… Advertising?

276
14:35.270 --> 14:37.690
Oh. I'm Ma Hee-chan, his manager.

277
14:37.773 --> 14:40.859
I'm here to make your client an exceptional offer.

278
14:40.943 --> 14:43.362
Sir, I would love to speak with you in private.

279
14:43.445 --> 14:45.155
Would that be all right with you?

280
14:51.412 --> 14:52.997
Oh my gosh! Ah!

281
14:53.080 --> 14:55.290
Yikes. Why are you creeping around?

282
14:55.374 --> 14:56.542
Miss Bo-bae.

283
14:57.167 --> 14:59.211
What? Spit it out.

284
14:59.712 --> 15:02.464
-[gasps] -I've been giving this a lot of thought.

285
15:02.548 --> 15:04.049
What do you want?

286
15:04.133 --> 15:05.718
I've realized something.

287
15:05.801 --> 15:09.179
Over the past few days, I've been unspeakably rude to you.

288
15:09.763 --> 15:10.723
What are you…

289
15:11.223 --> 15:13.684
Wait, are you buttering me up because you need a charge?

290
15:13.767 --> 15:15.310
Why are you acting so nice?

291
15:15.394 --> 15:16.645
I just

292
15:17.187 --> 15:18.313
wanted to say

293
15:19.023 --> 15:20.649
I feel terrible.

294
15:21.650 --> 15:23.569
Oh. You do?

295
15:24.570 --> 15:26.447
Well, that's really nice to know.

296
15:27.031 --> 15:28.157
[gentle music playing]

297
15:28.866 --> 15:29.783
[Ho-rang] So?

298
15:30.534 --> 15:33.579
Will you forgive me for being unspeakably rude?

299
15:33.662 --> 15:35.122
[heartbeat pounding]

300
15:35.205 --> 15:38.333
[Bo-bae] I've never been this close to someone before.

301
15:39.835 --> 15:40.836
[Ho-rang] Tell me,

302
15:41.503 --> 15:42.546
am I forgiven?

303
15:45.257 --> 15:46.383
Uh, well,

304
15:47.051 --> 15:47.885
I guess so.

305
15:47.968 --> 15:48.886
[gasps]

306
15:49.762 --> 15:51.930
[sighs] Wonderful.

307
15:52.014 --> 15:53.599
Now that we respect each other…

308
15:55.726 --> 15:57.019
[sighs]

309
15:57.102 --> 15:58.604
…let's draw up a contract.

310
15:58.687 --> 16:00.647
-[record scratch] -What are you…

311
16:01.148 --> 16:05.110
To celebrate its 30th anniversary, TS Resort is looking for a fresh new face.

312
16:05.903 --> 16:08.781
We'd like you to be the ambassador for our brand.

313
16:09.364 --> 16:11.742
Meaning you would be the new face of TS Group.

314
16:13.911 --> 16:15.537
A provisional contract.

315
16:15.621 --> 16:18.123
It's a one-year term with a generous signing bonus.

316
16:20.209 --> 16:22.586
Oh. Wait.

317
16:23.087 --> 16:25.672
I think they wrote this wrong. There are way too many zeroes here.

318
16:25.756 --> 16:27.007
[chuckles softly]

319
16:27.508 --> 16:28.926
It's right, I promise you.

320
16:29.009 --> 16:32.304
TS values you, and that number shows they're serious.

321
16:32.387 --> 16:34.389
But there's always room for negotiation.

322
16:34.473 --> 16:36.683
You're a major star. It's time you were moving up.

323
16:38.143 --> 16:39.436
[papers rustling]

324
16:40.938 --> 16:43.649
A legally binding contract for three months,

325
16:43.732 --> 16:46.068
which includes a touching provision between us.

326
16:46.151 --> 16:48.529
[Bo-bae hesitating]

327
16:48.612 --> 16:50.155
-Wait. Touching what? -Provision.

328
16:50.239 --> 16:54.076
Non-romantic skin-to-skin contact. All platonic.

329
16:54.159 --> 16:55.744
[curious music playing]

330
16:57.746 --> 16:58.664
So, what…

331
16:58.747 --> 17:02.042
Uh, I have a couple of questions…

332
17:02.126 --> 17:04.670
Yeah. Sure, ask me anything. [inhales sharply]

333
17:05.379 --> 17:06.588
Is it possible you have

334
17:08.048 --> 17:08.966
brain damage?

335
17:09.633 --> 17:11.260
[Ho-rang hesitates, sighs]

336
17:11.343 --> 17:13.262
Nope. My brain's okay.

337
17:13.762 --> 17:16.723
It's not though. Look at your eyes. You've got the crazy eyes.

338
17:16.807 --> 17:19.268
So am I to understand you don't wanna be my in-charge?

339
17:19.351 --> 17:20.394
Do I look like I do?

340
17:20.477 --> 17:21.395
[chuckles]

341
17:21.478 --> 17:22.646
[chuckles sarcastically]

342
17:22.729 --> 17:24.690
[laughing]

343
17:24.773 --> 17:26.984
[laughter continues through gritted teeth]

344
17:29.236 --> 17:30.154
[Bo-bae sighs]

345
17:31.196 --> 17:33.991
Hey, Mr. Businessman, you call that a pitch?

346
17:34.658 --> 17:36.160
-Ha! -[music fades]

347
17:36.243 --> 17:37.369
[Eun-ho] I can't, I'm sorry.

348
17:38.537 --> 17:41.373
No matter how much you're offering, I'm not interested in doing ads.

349
17:42.583 --> 17:45.127
I'm a serious actor, I don't want to be known for commercials.

350
17:45.210 --> 17:48.547
I believe that in order to be taken seriously, you have to do it all.

351
17:48.630 --> 17:50.716
A jack-of-all-trades. A perfect actor.

352
17:51.633 --> 17:52.593
Right…

353
17:54.052 --> 17:55.596
I don't want your kind of perfection.

354
17:57.097 --> 18:01.560
I'm more than happy to excel by being the best version of who I am right now.

355
18:09.234 --> 18:12.070
-[disbelieving chuckle] -[driver] Congratulations, ma'am.

356
18:12.905 --> 18:13.739
What for?

357
18:13.822 --> 18:16.617
I thought the smile was because you landed the contract.

358
18:16.700 --> 18:19.203
Oh… Not quite yet, no.

359
18:20.204 --> 18:21.288
But it is funny.

360
18:22.039 --> 18:24.208
He's nothing more than a pretty face,

361
18:24.291 --> 18:27.336
and yet he still manages to be completely full of himself.

362
18:29.421 --> 18:32.132
I hoped to come back with the best present Mr. Baek's ever gotten,

363
18:32.216 --> 18:34.134
but… thanks anyway.

364
18:35.302 --> 18:38.222
-[woman] Enjoy your meal, sir. -Thank you very much.

365
18:39.973 --> 18:41.308
Sorry, excuse me.

366
18:41.391 --> 18:43.977
Do I get my meal soon? I'm so hungry, I'm starving.

367
18:44.561 --> 18:45.646
Have you passed gas?

368
18:45.729 --> 18:48.440
I'm only supposed to feed you after you've passed gas.

369
18:48.523 --> 18:50.817
Ah… No, nothing yet.

370
18:50.901 --> 18:52.194
That's not true.

371
18:52.694 --> 18:53.570
What?

372
18:53.654 --> 18:55.822
-[whimsical music playing] -But I haven't yet.

373
18:55.906 --> 18:57.783
You did. Early this morning.

374
18:58.867 --> 18:59.701
Poof.

375
18:59.785 --> 19:01.912
[Bo-bae snoring]

376
19:06.124 --> 19:07.793
-[loud snore] -[Ho-rang gasps]

377
19:09.002 --> 19:11.129
-[snoring continues] -[sighs]

378
19:11.213 --> 19:12.464
[snoring continues]

379
19:15.467 --> 19:16.385
Would you mind--

380
19:16.468 --> 19:17.594
[Bo-bae farts loudly]

381
19:18.637 --> 19:20.347
[snoring resumes]

382
19:24.685 --> 19:26.853
[server] Oh, wonderful, you passed gas!

383
19:26.937 --> 19:29.856
I'll let the nurse know right away. She'll bring you your meal.

384
19:29.940 --> 19:31.233
[Bo-bae chuckles awkwardly]

385
19:36.655 --> 19:37.489
[clears throat]

386
19:39.533 --> 19:42.286
Wow, so I did it, huh? That's good…

387
19:42.369 --> 19:44.997
I thought your bed was gonna collapse it was so loud.

388
19:51.795 --> 19:52.963
Be careful out there.

389
19:53.547 --> 19:54.631
[chuckles] Watch your fart…

390
19:54.715 --> 19:55.674
Heart!

391
20:00.762 --> 20:01.888
[Ho-rang slurps]

392
20:02.681 --> 20:04.016
Ah!

393
20:04.099 --> 20:05.267
The sound of silence.

394
20:07.602 --> 20:08.770
[music stops]

395
20:09.271 --> 20:11.940
Ugh. So embarrassing!

396
20:14.067 --> 20:16.611
Why? It's perfectly natural.

397
20:17.112 --> 20:19.114
It means my body is working well.

398
20:20.574 --> 20:23.327
Oh no, I hate it!

399
20:23.410 --> 20:25.662
[whimpers, sighs]

400
20:25.746 --> 20:27.164
[Eun-ho] What do you hate?

401
20:28.498 --> 20:29.583
Eun-ho.

402
20:31.251 --> 20:32.336
[both chuckle]

403
20:33.170 --> 20:34.087
[sighs]

404
20:38.050 --> 20:38.884
[chuckles]

405
20:39.968 --> 20:41.428
[door opens]

406
20:42.637 --> 20:43.972
[door closes]

407
20:46.475 --> 20:47.309
Mr. Baek.

408
20:48.143 --> 20:49.936
[footsteps approaching]

409
20:53.190 --> 20:55.192
The chairwoman told me what happened.

410
20:55.776 --> 20:58.445
Since we're business partners now, I thought I should visit.

411
20:59.946 --> 21:02.366
Though she didn't say what the surgery was for?

412
21:04.534 --> 21:05.744
Uh, appendicitis.

413
21:06.536 --> 21:09.373
But the doctor told me I wasn't supposed to have visitors yet.

414
21:09.456 --> 21:10.749
[Seol-hee chuckles]

415
21:10.832 --> 21:13.126
I wasn't planning on staying too long.

416
21:13.210 --> 21:16.338
When I heard you were here, I made the trip to see you.

417
21:17.255 --> 21:20.300
-I'll walk you out. -Oh, no need. I just got here.

418
21:20.801 --> 21:23.762
I'll only stay a few minutes, since you're not feeling well.

419
21:23.845 --> 21:27.182
You're so busy You shouldn't be trapped in the hospital.

420
21:32.229 --> 21:33.313
Uh… [sighs]

421
21:34.106 --> 21:35.023
[Seol-hee] Hm.

422
21:37.567 --> 21:39.569
-You feeling any better yet? -Mm-hmm.

423
21:41.113 --> 21:43.615
Uh, should you even be here right now?

424
21:43.698 --> 21:46.159
It's like you don't even know you're famous!

425
21:47.369 --> 21:49.955
So what if I am? I can't visit a friend in hospital?

426
21:51.206 --> 21:52.374
Uh… [chuckles softly]

427
21:52.874 --> 21:55.085
Are you sure everything's okay though?

428
21:56.628 --> 21:58.088
You're pale and awfully thin.

429
21:59.256 --> 22:00.674
[jaunty music playing]

430
22:00.757 --> 22:01.591
Yeah?

431
22:01.675 --> 22:02.634
Mm.

432
22:05.387 --> 22:07.013
No, I'm all right. I'm not sick.

433
22:07.889 --> 22:09.141
It's just that

434
22:10.183 --> 22:11.685
I'm still not really eating.

435
22:11.768 --> 22:13.228
Just a bit stressed.

436
22:13.311 --> 22:15.647
What? Who's stressing you out?

437
22:17.607 --> 22:20.402
You're a bit flushed, too, now I'm really looking at you.

438
22:20.485 --> 22:21.570
You sure you okay?

439
22:22.195 --> 22:25.824
[Bo-bae] Obviously I'm flushed. Your gorgeous face is inches away.

440
22:33.248 --> 22:35.584
[Eun-ho] Is it Director Yeom Min-kyu?

441
22:37.502 --> 22:40.088
[Bo-bae] Yeah, him. Not just him…

442
22:40.672 --> 22:43.717
Ugh, thanks for the reminder. Now I'm really stressed.

443
22:43.800 --> 22:46.636
He told me I only had three months to rework the romance.

444
22:46.720 --> 22:51.308
[Eun-ho] Like he's an expert on romance. He doesn't know what he's talking about.

445
22:51.391 --> 22:53.310
I think everything you write is great.

446
22:53.393 --> 22:55.687
You would, because you're my fan.

447
22:55.770 --> 22:58.148
No matter what I write, you always say it's great.

448
22:58.648 --> 23:00.734
Oh no, what am I gonna do?

449
23:01.234 --> 23:03.695
Oh, that romance is killing me!

450
23:04.696 --> 23:06.781
If you wanted, I could, uh…

451
23:06.865 --> 23:09.284
-[clears throat] -[gentle music playing]

452
23:09.367 --> 23:11.995
…I could help you with the romantic stuff.

453
23:14.664 --> 23:15.582
Wha…

454
23:15.665 --> 23:18.543
Well, how are you planning on helping me with all that?

455
23:19.544 --> 23:21.254
Uh, I mean…

456
23:21.338 --> 23:22.839
I'm an actor, that's all…

457
23:22.923 --> 23:24.132
Mr. Baek?

458
23:25.091 --> 23:27.469
-Do you know those guests? -I don't.

459
23:29.638 --> 23:31.264
I don't know that woman.

460
23:31.765 --> 23:35.227
[Bo-bae] But his true identity's shrouded in all this mystery.

461
23:35.310 --> 23:37.896
He could be the son of a rival boss or…

462
23:38.730 --> 23:40.315
-[Yeom] Na Bo-bae the writer? -Mm-hmm.

463
23:40.398 --> 23:42.025
Yeah, she's new. I'm working with her.

464
23:42.108 --> 23:43.818
Three months left on her contract.

465
23:43.902 --> 23:46.404
Hey, stop wasting time! That won't be in the shot.

466
23:47.822 --> 23:51.409
And what about her script? The romance elements, how are they?

467
23:51.493 --> 23:52.744
Ah, they're weak.

468
23:52.827 --> 23:55.247
I told her to go out and date someone for inspiration.

469
23:55.330 --> 23:57.165
I'm surprised you're interested in her work.

470
23:57.749 --> 24:00.544
-Right, thanks. Take care. -Baek Ho-rang!

471
24:01.836 --> 24:03.046
What?

472
24:03.713 --> 24:05.799
Hmm… hmm.

473
24:06.341 --> 24:07.467
[purposeful music playing]

474
24:07.551 --> 24:09.553
If someone was standing right in front of me,

475
24:09.636 --> 24:12.681
practically begging me to ask what's wrong, I'd wanna know.

476
24:13.348 --> 24:15.350
So that's what she wants.

477
24:16.226 --> 24:18.562
She's so desperate to fix her sad little script

478
24:18.645 --> 24:21.022
that she'll put the moves on anyone.

479
24:23.400 --> 24:25.318
[chuckling]

480
24:26.361 --> 24:28.655
I bet the two of us can strike a deal.

481
24:30.156 --> 24:31.241
[music fades]

482
24:34.077 --> 24:37.080
-[Seol-hee] Do you know those guests? -I don't.

483
24:38.915 --> 24:40.667
I don't know that woman.

484
24:43.211 --> 24:45.505
[Bo-bae] The male lead ends up becoming a bodyguard,

485
24:45.589 --> 24:48.091
but his true identity's shrouded in all this mystery.

486
24:49.467 --> 24:51.386
He said, "I don't know that woman."

487
24:52.095 --> 24:53.930
Why did he single her out?

488
24:55.181 --> 24:56.182
[chuckles softly]

489
25:00.437 --> 25:01.771
[sighs]

490
25:02.564 --> 25:04.816
[electricity sizzling]

491
25:05.817 --> 25:07.027
[music fades]

492
25:14.492 --> 25:16.369
[screams, gasps]

493
25:17.829 --> 25:20.832
Is that Na Bo-bae, the writer?

494
25:20.915 --> 25:22.125
[calming music playing]

495
25:22.208 --> 25:23.460
What?

496
25:25.128 --> 25:27.297
Why are you… What are you doing here?

497
25:27.380 --> 25:30.467
You scared me! I almost passed out! Ugh, my stomach…

498
25:30.967 --> 25:33.178
You won the top prize at the NBS Drama contest

499
25:33.261 --> 25:35.472
and debuted with the drama Wistful Youth.

500
25:35.555 --> 25:38.308
For three years, you've been working on a romance miniseries

501
25:38.391 --> 25:40.185
with the director Yeom Min-kyu.

502
25:41.478 --> 25:43.605
Did you run a background check on me?

503
25:43.688 --> 25:46.441
But the romance is weak, and you're not making progress.

504
25:47.651 --> 25:49.569
You have three months until your contracts over.

505
25:49.653 --> 25:52.113
Well, my romance series is none of your business.

506
25:53.448 --> 25:54.449
[chuckles smugly]

507
25:55.867 --> 25:59.245
The guy you were talking to outside before, is he your boyfriend?

508
26:00.413 --> 26:03.124
No. We're just… We're really good friends.

509
26:03.208 --> 26:04.292
Oh, yeah?

510
26:05.502 --> 26:06.503
Right.

511
26:07.837 --> 26:11.675
I'm sure you've noticed that, objectively speaking, I'm quite the catch.

512
26:11.758 --> 26:15.136
I've got looks, money, social status, personality…

513
26:15.220 --> 26:16.471
[Bo-bae scoffs]

514
26:18.056 --> 26:19.224
What's so funny?

515
26:19.307 --> 26:22.143
I mean, I'll admit you have most of that,

516
26:22.227 --> 26:24.396
but it's not a winning personality.

517
26:24.479 --> 26:27.649
On the contrary, wherever I go, I get noticed.

518
26:27.732 --> 26:30.527
People see me as a true gentleman with impeccable manners.

519
26:30.610 --> 26:33.113
Impeccable manners, wow…

520
26:33.738 --> 26:34.864
Ah.

521
26:34.948 --> 26:38.410
[Ho-rang scoffs] Anyway, I'm used to getting attention.

522
26:38.493 --> 26:40.203
I'm used to being hit on.

523
26:40.704 --> 26:43.331
But work keeps me busy, plus with my heart issues,

524
26:43.415 --> 26:45.917
I don't do long-term relationships.

525
26:47.043 --> 26:48.628
-You sound so proud. -I am.

526
26:48.712 --> 26:52.173
I'm trying to impress you here. When it comes to romance, I'm your guy.

527
26:54.509 --> 26:57.137
Hm. I have a new offer.

528
26:57.721 --> 27:00.181
If you commit to the contract for three months,

529
27:00.265 --> 27:03.351
I'll teach you about romance, since you need the help.

530
27:03.435 --> 27:05.353
And then you can fix your writing.

531
27:07.939 --> 27:09.107
Do we have a deal?

532
27:16.281 --> 27:18.283
[music fades]

533
27:18.366 --> 27:19.951
[footsteps padding]

534
27:20.034 --> 27:22.704
[Ho-rang breathes deeply]

535
27:24.664 --> 27:26.666
[curious music playing]

536
27:27.417 --> 27:29.878
Na Bo-bae?

537
27:32.297 --> 27:33.131
Sir?

538
27:35.133 --> 27:36.342
[music fades]

539
27:37.010 --> 27:38.887
What? What?

540
27:38.970 --> 27:40.013
[Yang] Never mind.

541
27:40.555 --> 27:42.974
-[groans] -I brought the documents you requested.

542
27:43.057 --> 27:44.267
[Ho-rang] Mmm.

543
27:45.935 --> 27:47.103
[sighs]

544
27:51.107 --> 27:52.484
You awake over there?

545
27:54.360 --> 27:57.071
You said you'd think about it. Do you have your answer?

546
27:58.698 --> 28:01.951
I know you can't still be sleeping. I can hear you breathing from here.

547
28:07.040 --> 28:09.209
-Pull the curtain. -Sir.

548
28:13.838 --> 28:16.508
She's not here. But she left something.

549
28:17.133 --> 28:18.885
[Bo-bae] Emergency Charging Station.

550
28:18.968 --> 28:21.888
-58-1 Songan-dong, Geumjin-gu, Seoul. -A note.

551
28:21.971 --> 28:24.140
[Bo-bae] Don't show up unless you're really about to die.

552
28:24.224 --> 28:27.393
What? "Emergency Charging Station"?

553
28:29.854 --> 28:30.897
[sighs]

554
28:31.731 --> 28:34.692
Was I wrong to leave him behind? He does have a heart condition…

555
28:35.777 --> 28:36.611
[clicks tongue]

556
28:37.195 --> 28:39.531
Oh, whatever. He has my address, it's fine.

557
28:39.614 --> 28:42.367
It's not like I didn't try to help him. I really did.

558
28:44.786 --> 28:46.496
-Okay. -[typing]

559
28:46.579 --> 28:49.415
“I-hyeok leans in

560
28:50.124 --> 28:55.505
and buckles Hye-ju's seatbelt…”

561
28:59.008 --> 29:00.760
[whimsical music playing]

562
29:05.515 --> 29:07.767
You have to put on your seatbelt, please, ma'am.

563
29:10.854 --> 29:12.897
[whining] I don't feel like it, no.

564
29:14.774 --> 29:17.110
-[seat belt unbuckles] -[door opens]

565
29:17.652 --> 29:21.364
I-HYEOK GETS OUT OF THE CAR AND OPENS THE BACK DOOR.

566
29:22.907 --> 29:24.492
[secretly pleased] What's wrong?

567
29:27.871 --> 29:30.373
-You want me to do it for you? -[flustered] What?

568
29:31.833 --> 29:32.917
[seat belt buckles]

569
29:33.710 --> 29:35.753
I-HYEOK CUPS HYE-JU'S CHEEK

570
29:36.337 --> 29:37.547
What else do you want?

571
29:37.630 --> 29:39.757
[sweeping romantic music playing]

572
29:39.841 --> 29:43.386
HYE-JU LOOKS AT HIM, NERVOUS

573
29:45.597 --> 29:47.265
[music becomes uneasy]

574
29:47.891 --> 29:50.476
I told you, when it comes to romance, I'm your guy.

575
29:50.560 --> 29:53.730
Now how about we celebrate with a little skin-on-skin?

576
29:56.065 --> 29:57.150
[frustrated groan]

577
29:57.233 --> 30:01.905
Ugh! He's even in my scripts! And what was he talking about before?

578
30:01.988 --> 30:04.490
He'll date me in exchange for physical contact?

579
30:04.574 --> 30:06.367
Ugh, he's completely nuts!

580
30:06.451 --> 30:07.827
Besides, the doctor told us

581
30:07.911 --> 30:09.996
being in close proximity would charge the battery.

582
30:10.079 --> 30:12.206
"Touching provision," gross! That ass!

583
30:12.290 --> 30:14.918
[yelling frustratedly]

584
30:16.377 --> 30:19.005
-Ugh! He's a jerk! He's crazy! -[Ji-hye sighs]

585
30:19.672 --> 30:21.424
She must be in so much pain.

586
30:22.008 --> 30:24.052
[gasping emotionally]

587
30:24.552 --> 30:26.554
Oh no, our poor sweet sis.

588
30:32.393 --> 30:33.394
[music fades]

589
30:37.106 --> 30:39.692
Are you sure you're fine to start working again?

590
30:39.776 --> 30:42.195
Oh yeah, the hospital said that it was all right.

591
30:42.278 --> 30:45.073
It looked like you were in a lot of pain before.

592
30:48.493 --> 30:49.535
[Ji-hye sighs]

593
30:50.995 --> 30:52.705
[pop ballad playing]

594
30:59.253 --> 31:00.797
What is he doing here?

595
31:06.219 --> 31:07.929
♪ I know who you are… ♪

596
31:08.012 --> 31:10.765
Set me up near that woman.

597
31:10.848 --> 31:12.976
[Yang] Yes. Here's the closest table.

598
31:13.059 --> 31:13.893
What?

599
31:13.977 --> 31:17.772
♪ Don't hesitate No matter what you had planned for ♪

600
31:17.855 --> 31:20.650
♪ We got to move on now ♪

601
31:20.733 --> 31:24.737
♪ Oh, isn't it right To be who we should be? ♪

602
31:24.821 --> 31:26.155
♪ Don't say it's just a metaphor ♪

603
31:26.239 --> 31:33.037
♪ I'm turning pages Of stories only meant for us ♪

604
31:33.538 --> 31:35.039
♪ We gotta make it ♪

605
31:35.123 --> 31:40.086
♪ Until we see this journey end… ♪

606
31:40.586 --> 31:42.463
♪ I know what you're ready… ♪

607
31:42.547 --> 31:44.007
Everything's ready for you.

608
31:44.090 --> 31:48.052
♪ Been waiting to let you down ♪

609
31:48.136 --> 31:52.098
♪ Only thing I meant to say It's only you and me ♪

610
31:52.181 --> 31:55.184
♪ Can't you see This story is all meant for… ♪

611
31:55.268 --> 31:56.894
What do you think you're doing?

612
31:57.729 --> 31:59.856
Getting acquainted with my new office.

613
32:00.648 --> 32:02.942
We would like to rent this table starting now.

614
32:03.818 --> 32:05.778
-Two million won enough? -[Ji-hye gasps]

615
32:05.862 --> 32:07.155
Two million won?

616
32:08.656 --> 32:10.783
No, thanks. I'll have to ask you to leave--

617
32:10.867 --> 32:13.161
Two million it is. Welcome, sir.

618
32:13.244 --> 32:15.663
We hope you enjoy your personal workspace here.

619
32:16.664 --> 32:18.374
Zip it.

620
32:18.458 --> 32:20.793
♪ Turning pages Of stories only meant… ♪

621
32:20.877 --> 32:21.711
But…

622
32:24.630 --> 32:25.882
♪ We gotta make it… ♪

623
32:25.965 --> 32:27.008
Get to work.

624
32:27.091 --> 32:31.137
♪ …until this journey ends ♪

625
32:31.888 --> 32:34.891
♪ I know what you're ready to die for… ♪

626
32:34.974 --> 32:37.518
-Good night. Thanks a lot. -See you next time.

627
32:39.353 --> 32:43.566
♪ Only thing I meant to say It's only you and me ♪

628
32:43.649 --> 32:48.488
♪ Can't you see This story is all meant for love ♪

629
32:48.571 --> 32:50.198
[loud squeak]

630
32:53.117 --> 32:55.870
[sighs] We're closing for the night, sir, if you please.

631
33:00.583 --> 33:03.753
My stuff can stay where it is because we'll be back tomorrow.

632
33:05.296 --> 33:06.130
Hey!

633
33:06.881 --> 33:09.550
Are you actually planning to sit there every day for three months?

634
33:09.634 --> 33:10.885
I said… [hesitates]

635
33:12.386 --> 33:15.765
Look, I said… [whispers] this is an emergency charging station.

636
33:15.848 --> 33:17.892
"Emergency." You know what that means?

637
33:19.936 --> 33:22.105
I deal with emergencies every day.

638
33:22.188 --> 33:24.565
And you still haven't given me your answer.

639
33:24.649 --> 33:26.359
Trading touch for romance.

640
33:27.902 --> 33:29.278
Think on it. I'll wait.

641
33:30.363 --> 33:31.656
Tomorrow, I'll ask again.

642
33:34.283 --> 33:36.410
[lively music playing]

643
33:42.542 --> 33:43.501
[Bo-bae sighs]

644
33:43.584 --> 33:45.753
[door opens, closes]

645
33:45.837 --> 33:47.338
[groans]

646
33:48.673 --> 33:49.966
[frustrated whining]

647
34:14.949 --> 34:16.951
Your drinks are ready.

648
34:18.953 --> 34:19.996
[loud click]

649
34:34.677 --> 34:35.887
[chimes tinkling]

650
34:50.985 --> 34:52.069
Thank you, sir.

651
34:55.072 --> 34:56.073
[watch chimes]

652
35:15.384 --> 35:17.178
[lively music continues]

653
35:24.518 --> 35:25.519
[watch chimes]

654
35:32.818 --> 35:34.111
[sighs]

655
35:37.698 --> 35:38.824
[music fades]

656
35:39.492 --> 35:40.952
You have to stop coming here.

657
35:41.953 --> 35:45.498
You're the one who gave me the address. You told me where I could find you.

658
35:46.707 --> 35:49.543
The note specifically said only come here if you're actually dying.

659
35:49.627 --> 35:50.836
[Ho-rang] That's the thing.

660
35:50.920 --> 35:53.506
The second you leave my side, I feel like I'm dying.

661
35:53.589 --> 35:55.341
[romantic music playing]

662
35:56.634 --> 36:00.304
This is the only place we can be together, and that's hard enough.

663
36:00.388 --> 36:01.806
I just wanna be around you.

664
36:01.889 --> 36:03.182
Oh my God…

665
36:04.225 --> 36:05.726
[Ho-rang] Say I can stay.

666
36:05.810 --> 36:06.811
[music stops]

667
36:06.894 --> 36:08.604
Just let me stay by your side.

668
36:11.065 --> 36:12.817
[sighs] Fine, you win.

669
36:16.070 --> 36:16.988
Huh?

670
36:17.071 --> 36:18.114
-Come here. -[Bo-bae] Why?

671
36:18.197 --> 36:19.490
Just come on.

672
36:19.573 --> 36:20.574
[Bo-bae sighs]

673
36:21.742 --> 36:22.660
Huh?

674
36:23.286 --> 36:24.912
-What? -Stop.

675
36:24.996 --> 36:27.915
You keep trying to kick that customer out. What's wrong with you?

676
36:27.999 --> 36:30.626
The cafe's been busy since he started showing up.

677
36:30.710 --> 36:32.837
We were doing just fine without his help, I'm sure.

678
36:32.920 --> 36:36.132
"Just fine" is miles away from "busy," isn't it?

679
36:36.215 --> 36:38.718
Also, how did you even meet him?

680
36:38.801 --> 36:41.595
He's so incredibly handsome. He looks superrich too.

681
36:41.679 --> 36:45.308
Well… He's just someone from the hospital. We met there.

682
36:45.391 --> 36:48.019
Does he like you? What about the shocks?

683
36:48.102 --> 36:50.479
-Does he not know about that yet? -[sighs]

684
36:50.563 --> 36:53.441
You have to get your electric stuff under control if you two--

685
36:53.524 --> 36:56.610
It's not like that. I don't wanna talk about it.

686
36:56.694 --> 36:58.321
[jaunty music playing]

687
36:58.404 --> 37:00.156
-Ugh! -Uh-uh.

688
37:00.239 --> 37:01.782
Ugh, what now?

689
37:01.866 --> 37:03.784
Don't you dare go talk to him again.

690
37:04.410 --> 37:05.411
Come on.

691
37:06.078 --> 37:07.204
[Bo-bae groans]

692
37:10.041 --> 37:11.125
[sighs]

693
37:14.503 --> 37:16.088
[calming music playing]

694
37:29.602 --> 37:30.853
[exhales slowly]

695
37:34.690 --> 37:36.108
[exhales slowly]

696
37:37.902 --> 37:38.944
[watch chimes]

697
37:43.032 --> 37:45.618
-[inhales deeply, sighs heavily] -[music fades]

698
37:47.119 --> 37:48.913
[mischievous music playing]

699
37:49.914 --> 37:51.290
The charge,

700
37:52.583 --> 37:54.877
what's making it drain so fast?

701
37:55.795 --> 37:57.296
[music continues]

702
38:01.926 --> 38:03.469
[Ho-rang groans]

703
38:05.012 --> 38:07.598
How long has it been since I was discharged?

704
38:09.308 --> 38:10.434
Exactly one week, sir.

705
38:11.060 --> 38:14.146
The longest week of my life. This is ridiculous.

706
38:15.731 --> 38:17.233
How do I last three months?

707
38:17.316 --> 38:20.361
The time will fly by. You'll just have to be patient.

708
38:20.444 --> 38:25.074
I've been polite and I've smiled, and that smile always works.

709
38:26.325 --> 38:28.702
But it doesn't work on her. [groans]

710
38:28.786 --> 38:31.288
Maybe she can't get past your initial impression.

711
38:31.372 --> 38:33.332
You were pretty rude. I can't really blame her.

712
38:34.125 --> 38:35.126
I wasn't that bad.

713
38:36.419 --> 38:39.713
Besides, even if you two got along perfectly,

714
38:39.797 --> 38:41.966
it would be hard to spend the whole day together.

715
38:42.049 --> 38:43.467
Living in separate houses.

716
38:44.218 --> 38:47.012
Separate… houses?

717
38:47.096 --> 38:49.098
[cell phone buzzing]

718
38:52.017 --> 38:53.018
[Ho-rang sighs]

719
38:53.102 --> 38:54.353
Yes, Grandma?

720
38:55.563 --> 38:57.273
Yes. I'll be there soon.

721
38:57.773 --> 38:58.858
All right.

722
38:59.775 --> 39:02.653
We'll go to the resort, then to Pyeonchang-dong.

723
39:02.736 --> 39:05.948
Maybe we should see Miss Bo-bae first. Don't you need a charge?

724
39:08.534 --> 39:10.703
I'll just take care of this nice and quick.

725
39:20.045 --> 39:21.839
[contemplative music playing]

726
39:30.014 --> 39:31.807
[music fades]

727
39:32.766 --> 39:35.186
Hey, I thought you had plans in Sangam tonight.

728
39:35.269 --> 39:37.938
-Shouldn't you be heading out? -Oh yeah, look at the time.

729
39:38.022 --> 39:39.690
-[Ji-hye] Writers' meeting, right? -Uh-huh.

730
39:39.773 --> 39:42.735
With old classmates from the drama academy. See you later.

731
39:42.818 --> 39:45.946
-Okay, have fun. -[Bo-bae] Oh, and just in case, uh…

732
39:49.283 --> 39:51.285
Forget it. [chuckles] Bye-bye.

733
39:53.662 --> 39:54.580
Bye.

734
39:59.418 --> 40:01.212
[tense music playing]

735
40:05.716 --> 40:06.967
[music fades]

736
40:07.051 --> 40:08.052
[Ho-rang sighs]

737
40:15.935 --> 40:17.645
[Ho-rang sighs]

738
40:18.854 --> 40:22.274
Ho-rang. Why the long face? Got some bad news to share?

739
40:22.942 --> 40:24.401
No, I've just got a lot on my mind.

740
40:24.485 --> 40:28.030
I'm disappointed you can't complete your work during business hours.

741
40:28.822 --> 40:30.741
I wasn't doing work, I was checking the time.

742
40:30.824 --> 40:33.327
So bored of us already, are you?

743
40:33.410 --> 40:37.498
Mom, my son Do-yoon prioritizes family and does excellent work.

744
40:37.581 --> 40:40.668
Remember, how he organized TS Hotel's 30th anniversary event?

745
40:41.252 --> 40:43.712
And he did it all without complaint. Tirelessly.

746
40:43.796 --> 40:47.174
-He was buzzing all over like a busy bee. -I was? Really?

747
40:47.258 --> 40:48.092
Shut up.

748
40:48.175 --> 40:51.303
The busy bee certainly succeeded in humiliating our company.

749
40:51.387 --> 40:52.888
[aunt] Oh, Mom…

750
40:52.972 --> 40:56.976
You can't listen to those articles. It was practically a peck on the cheek.

751
40:57.059 --> 40:59.311
-That's all it was. -Don't you condone his behavior!

752
41:00.062 --> 41:02.356
[grandma] Good thing I had the money to cover it up.

753
41:02.439 --> 41:05.484
But I don't enjoy burying incidents of sexual harassment.

754
41:05.568 --> 41:07.695
Ow! Oh, that's hot!

755
41:07.778 --> 41:10.281
The staff should not be serving it this hot!

756
41:10.364 --> 41:11.532
It's hot.

757
41:11.615 --> 41:14.034
Grandmother, the thing is,

758
41:14.118 --> 41:15.911
that night got blown out of proportion.

759
41:15.995 --> 41:19.582
I was just having fun at the club. In fact, I was actually there for work.

760
41:19.665 --> 41:21.166
Social media's a big deal right now.

761
41:21.250 --> 41:23.627
If you get a lot of followers, you're called an "influencer"--

762
41:23.711 --> 41:26.005
You assume I don't know what an influencer is?

763
41:26.589 --> 41:28.173
Wow, our chairwoman's so smart.

764
41:29.008 --> 41:30.301
Ho-rang,

765
41:30.384 --> 41:33.470
I understand you did an excellent job with the Jeju Resort.

766
41:33.554 --> 41:36.473
[Ho-rang] It went well. It should help with our rebranding.

767
41:37.057 --> 41:39.685
All we need is to find the perfect new face.

768
41:39.768 --> 41:42.938
Once we have, I expect the brand's value will more than triple.

769
41:43.522 --> 41:47.067
Maybe more, if you marry the daughter of Hanlim Advertising Company.

770
41:47.151 --> 41:49.570
-But you're dragging your feet. -[aunt] Mom!

771
41:49.653 --> 41:53.741
Just set her up with my son, Do-yoon. Please, Ho-rang doesn't even want her!

772
41:53.824 --> 41:56.619
Keep your voice down. You're scaring Bokdeongi.

773
41:56.702 --> 41:58.537
[tense music playing]

774
42:00.956 --> 42:02.750
Running off to a secret girlfriend?

775
42:08.714 --> 42:10.758
You practically ran outta there.

776
42:11.800 --> 42:12.801
[Ho-rang sighs]

777
42:13.427 --> 42:16.055
I can't stay. I don't have time to deal with you.

778
42:16.138 --> 42:20.059
You were looking at your watch all through dinner. Is something going on?

779
42:20.809 --> 42:23.479
What do you care anyway? It's none of your concern.

780
42:23.562 --> 42:26.231
-And I don't have to explain myself. -[scoffs]

781
42:26.315 --> 42:28.525
Why don't you go kiss up to Grandma?

782
42:28.609 --> 42:31.111
Tell her what an influencer is. She loved that one.

783
42:38.702 --> 42:42.998
If only our grandmother knew how much of a prick you are.

784
42:46.043 --> 42:47.544
[tires screech]

785
42:48.379 --> 42:50.089
[uneasy music playing]

786
42:59.848 --> 43:02.643
-Where's Miss Bo-bae? -She had plans. Out with friends--

787
43:02.726 --> 43:04.269
Where did she go?

788
43:04.353 --> 43:06.063
Why do you wanna know?

789
43:06.146 --> 43:08.065
[Ho-rang breathes heavily]

790
43:09.692 --> 43:13.779
I need to see her immediately. Can't you just tell me where she went?

791
43:15.656 --> 43:18.409
[woman 1] Ju-hee, you're about to start shooting, right?

792
43:18.492 --> 43:20.494
Mm-hmm, yeah.

793
43:20.577 --> 43:21.412
[woman 1] Mm.

794
43:21.495 --> 43:24.415
Get this, the two stars are Kim Hae-ri and Kang Jun

795
43:24.498 --> 43:26.166
and the director is Yeom Min-kyu.

796
43:26.250 --> 43:29.294
[woman 1] Wow, that's amazing! It's gonna be huge, I just know it!

797
43:29.378 --> 43:30.379
[Ju-hee] I hope so.

798
43:30.462 --> 43:35.134
NBS is promoting it as one of their most anticipated shows. [chuckles]

799
43:35.968 --> 43:37.761
Bo-bae, what about you?

800
43:37.845 --> 43:38.721
Huh?

801
43:38.804 --> 43:40.472
[clears throat, coughs] What?

802
43:40.556 --> 43:42.891
[Ju-hee] It's been forever since we saw you. How've you been?

803
43:42.975 --> 43:45.644
Every time we talk, you just say you're writing.

804
43:45.728 --> 43:47.271
So what are you working on?

805
43:50.315 --> 43:52.860
Hmm… It's, um… [clears throat]

806
43:52.943 --> 43:53.986
Mm…

807
43:55.446 --> 43:58.240
Uh, well, I'm currently working with Yeom Min-kyu too.

808
43:58.323 --> 44:01.660
Yeah, we'll probably start production once they're wrapped your show.

809
44:01.744 --> 44:04.163
Wait, you're writing Director Yeom's next project?

810
44:04.246 --> 44:08.834
Are you kidding, girl? Wow, that's so great! Congratulations!

811
44:09.418 --> 44:13.005
They've already found the male lead. It's Ji Eun-ho. You know who he is?

812
44:13.088 --> 44:16.759
Ji Eun-ho? You kidding? I'm a big fan! [gasps excitedly]

813
44:16.842 --> 44:18.927
[Bo-bae] Really? He's actually a good friend.

814
44:19.011 --> 44:21.430
He's been begging me to finish the script for my show

815
44:21.513 --> 44:23.807
the male lead so bad.

816
44:23.891 --> 44:27.144
So that's exciting. Ji Eun-ho is all set to star.

817
44:27.227 --> 44:28.896
[woman 2 chuckles]

818
44:28.979 --> 44:32.357
Ji Eun-ho's, like, a big deal. Does he have time for your show?

819
44:32.441 --> 44:34.902
Didn't he make you that promise when he was just starting out?

820
44:34.985 --> 44:37.905
I don't think so. I met up with him a few days ago

821
44:37.988 --> 44:40.240
and he still seemed interested in the script.

822
44:40.324 --> 44:44.119
Even if all I was doing was complaining about how stressed I was.

823
44:44.703 --> 44:45.996
It's just that

824
44:46.622 --> 44:49.833
you really shouldn't blindly trust whatever an actor says.

825
44:49.917 --> 44:52.461
Ji Eun-ho… He's probably booked years in advance.

826
44:52.544 --> 44:55.923
He has a busy schedule. He can't work on just anything.

827
44:56.006 --> 44:59.343
Especially for a writer who's barely made a name for herself.

828
44:59.927 --> 45:01.887
Oh yeah, you're right. That's true.

829
45:01.970 --> 45:05.641
"Barely made a name for herself," what am I saying? [inhales sharply]

830
45:05.724 --> 45:07.726
It's not like she's had a hit yet.

831
45:08.477 --> 45:09.645
Maybe one day.

832
45:09.728 --> 45:11.063
[pensive music playing]

833
45:15.567 --> 45:20.614
Hey, guys, If somebody at this table hasn't made it yet, it's me, not Bo-bae.

834
45:20.697 --> 45:22.616
She's already debuted her work.

835
45:22.699 --> 45:24.201
[Ju-hee] Right. Of course.

836
45:24.284 --> 45:26.578
I forgot. So she did.

837
45:30.332 --> 45:32.459
Oh, I was only looking out for our friend.

838
45:32.543 --> 45:33.460
[women giggle]

839
45:33.544 --> 45:34.795
[K-indie music playing]

840
45:34.878 --> 45:37.965
[Ju-hee] Imagine if the actor flakes on her. That would be terrible.

841
45:38.048 --> 45:40.092
-I couldn't let that happen to Bo-bae. -Hey, you.

842
45:40.175 --> 45:41.593
[Bo-bae gasps]

843
45:42.219 --> 45:43.720
-[Ju-hee gasps] -Ji Eun-ho!

844
45:43.804 --> 45:45.097
[coughs]

845
45:45.180 --> 45:46.181
Oh, hi.

846
45:46.265 --> 45:48.892
I was just passing by after dinner and saw you.

847
45:49.768 --> 45:51.186
Sorry, you're with your friends.

848
45:51.270 --> 45:52.312
[women chuckle]

849
45:52.396 --> 45:53.981
Uh… No worries. Hello…

850
45:54.064 --> 45:55.065
[giggling]

851
45:55.148 --> 45:57.359
Yes, we all went to drama school together.

852
45:57.442 --> 45:59.653
-Ah, so then you're all writers? -We are.

853
45:59.736 --> 46:03.323
You know, it's funny. We were just talking about you.

854
46:03.407 --> 46:05.409
[Korean ballad playing]

855
46:06.285 --> 46:07.119
[Eun-ho] Hey…

856
46:08.036 --> 46:09.580
They were good things, I hope?

857
46:09.663 --> 46:12.207
Oh yeah, of course, yeah. [giggles]

858
46:12.291 --> 46:13.917
If you're almost done, I can take you home.

859
46:14.001 --> 46:15.544
I'll be heading your way.

860
46:16.128 --> 46:18.338
-Uh… -No, I don't think we're quite done.

861
46:18.422 --> 46:20.716
Oh, come on… This is so cute! My gosh!

862
46:20.799 --> 46:23.343
-Oh, we gotta let them go! Ah! Yeah! -Go now!

863
46:23.427 --> 46:25.012
[woman 1] She's good. Go!

864
46:26.638 --> 46:27.890
Shall we?

865
46:29.349 --> 46:30.559
-Your bag. -Oh!

866
46:32.311 --> 46:34.646
[woman 1] Get home safe, girlfriend! Bye!

867
46:35.147 --> 46:36.899
-Great meeting you. [giggles] -Same.

868
46:42.195 --> 46:44.907
-Yeah. Almost felt like we summoned you. -[music fades]

869
46:44.990 --> 46:46.909
One minute we were talking about you. The next--

870
46:46.992 --> 46:49.286
[sighs] Saved you from a fate worse than death?

871
46:51.747 --> 46:53.790
You didn't overhear anything, did you?

872
46:53.874 --> 46:56.668
Well… maybe a bit of the last part.

873
46:57.419 --> 46:58.295
[Bo-bae sighs]

874
46:58.378 --> 47:00.339
You told me her name, Ju-hee?

875
47:00.422 --> 47:02.633
She's the one who wouldn't stop bullying you?

876
47:03.425 --> 47:06.887
I gotta say, you undersold her. She was even worse than your stories.

877
47:06.970 --> 47:09.514
She takes "stink eye" to a whole new level. Whoa!

878
47:09.598 --> 47:10.849
[chuckling]

879
47:10.933 --> 47:13.977
We all started writing at the same time, but I'm the only one still here.

880
47:14.853 --> 47:15.938
Kinda pathetic…

881
47:16.897 --> 47:18.315
Why do you say that?

882
47:19.107 --> 47:21.151
I think your writing's incredible.

883
47:21.234 --> 47:22.277
[gentle music playing]

884
47:22.361 --> 47:24.571
Seriously, I became an actor because of you.

885
47:25.155 --> 47:26.448
"Yes, it's true."

886
47:26.531 --> 47:29.326
"Studying for the civil service exam at my age is embarrassing."

887
47:30.077 --> 47:31.995
"But you can't give up! It's not time to."

888
47:33.038 --> 47:35.666
"You can't give up. It's not time to…"

889
47:36.500 --> 47:38.502
"You can't give up. It's not time to!"

890
47:38.585 --> 47:39.419
"You…"

891
47:39.503 --> 47:40.963
[whispers] "You can't give up."

892
47:41.964 --> 47:44.007
Sorry everyone. Sorry.

893
47:44.800 --> 47:46.093
[Yeom] Eun-ho…

894
47:46.760 --> 47:50.931
Is this a cold read? Have you ever read this script before out loud?

895
47:53.976 --> 47:55.102
I'm sorry, sir.

896
47:55.185 --> 47:58.230
[Yeom] Okay… Just relax. It's only one episode.

897
47:58.313 --> 48:01.650
If we wanna get out of here before dark, we have to get through it.

898
48:01.733 --> 48:04.569
-Truly sorry. Excuse me. -[Yeom] Let's start from the top.

899
48:05.320 --> 48:06.989
[music fades]

900
48:10.492 --> 48:11.702
Oh, hello.

901
48:14.579 --> 48:16.832
[sighs] I'm sorry for messing up your script.

902
48:22.337 --> 48:23.547
Wait, hang on…

903
48:25.590 --> 48:27.884
It… It's just you shouldn't be sorry.

904
48:27.968 --> 48:31.013
You didn't do anything wrong. You were so in character.

905
48:31.680 --> 48:35.183
Watching you, I thought, "Oh, okay, so he's more like this. Got it."

906
48:35.934 --> 48:36.977
[Bo-bae chuckles]

907
48:37.060 --> 48:39.813
I wrote the words, but you brought them to life.

908
48:41.189 --> 48:42.524
Thank you for that. Truly.

909
48:42.607 --> 48:44.776
-You took it seriously. -No, I should be thanking you--

910
48:44.860 --> 48:46.820
-No, I'm thanking you. -No, thank you, really.

911
48:46.903 --> 48:48.030
-No, I'm serious, thank-- -No.

912
48:48.113 --> 48:49.823
-I gotta thank you! -Thank you so much.

913
48:49.906 --> 48:52.284
[Eun-ho] I've been your number-one fan ever since.

914
48:53.827 --> 48:55.203
What I'm trying to say

915
48:55.287 --> 48:57.330
is it doesn't really matter what they think of you.

916
48:58.415 --> 49:01.501
You deserve better. Don't beat yourself up.

917
49:04.004 --> 49:05.839
Mm-hmm. [chuckles]

918
49:11.970 --> 49:15.515
[Ji-hye] She said she was going to Sangam to meet up with some friends,

919
49:15.599 --> 49:17.392
and then head straight home after.

920
49:17.476 --> 49:19.811
-[uneasy music playing] -[breathing shakily]

921
49:23.732 --> 49:25.484
[brakes squealing]

922
49:27.569 --> 49:28.695
[music stops]

923
49:35.202 --> 49:37.287
Okay, bye! Thanks again.

924
49:55.138 --> 49:56.348
[wistful music playing]

925
49:56.431 --> 49:59.476
WISHING THE GREATEST DAY TO THE GREATEST ACTOR

926
50:02.395 --> 50:04.272
[Bo-bae] You've done so much for me.

927
50:08.944 --> 50:13.740
A CITY BURSTING WITH CHARM: THIS IS THE HEART OF SEOUL

928
50:14.324 --> 50:16.284
[Bo-bae] But it's hard not to wonder…

929
50:16.952 --> 50:19.287
Everyone in this city is always moving forward,

930
50:19.371 --> 50:20.372
getting better.

931
50:20.455 --> 50:22.791
But I'm just stuck.

932
50:30.423 --> 50:33.009
No hit shows, no fame, no talent…

933
50:33.718 --> 50:35.971
But I act like I'm just as good as them.

934
50:36.054 --> 50:38.932
I pretend I'm doing great, but who am I kidding?

935
50:39.015 --> 50:42.018
That's all I do. Pretend, pretend, pretend.

936
50:42.769 --> 50:46.606
Why is everyone moving onto bigger things and leaving me behind?

937
50:48.316 --> 50:51.111
I wanna go too… [sighs]

938
51:06.585 --> 51:08.295
[uneasy music playing]

939
51:36.114 --> 51:37.991
[dramatic unsettling music playing]

940
51:48.168 --> 51:50.170
[screams]

941
51:57.093 --> 51:58.637
-[music fades] -[man groans]

942
51:58.720 --> 52:00.555
[Kang-ho breathes heavily]

943
52:01.806 --> 52:03.016
Get outta here.

944
52:03.808 --> 52:05.727
[footsteps recede]

945
52:09.522 --> 52:13.276
[hesitates] Mr. Baek, what are you… what are you doing here?

946
52:13.360 --> 52:14.402
[gasps]

947
52:14.986 --> 52:16.738
[romantic music playing]

948
52:29.584 --> 52:30.919
[watch chimes]

949
52:35.131 --> 52:36.216
[Ho-rang sighing]

950
52:37.968 --> 52:41.054
Miss Bo-bae, I… I can't lie anymore.

951
52:42.055 --> 52:43.056
[Bo-bae] Huh?

952
52:43.139 --> 52:45.392
[Ho-rang] My plan was to make sure you saw me every day.

953
52:46.226 --> 52:49.396
And that way, I might be able to win you over.

954
52:49.479 --> 52:51.106
[Bo-bae] What're you talking about?

955
52:51.189 --> 52:53.566
Get… Stop it, get off me. Oh.

956
52:54.442 --> 52:56.736
[Ho-rang sighs] But I can't wait.

957
52:57.862 --> 52:58.822
[Ho-rang pants]

958
52:59.406 --> 53:01.157
I can't take it slow.

959
53:02.701 --> 53:04.327
I can't live without you.

960
53:05.662 --> 53:08.081
If anything were to happen to you, I…

961
53:08.665 --> 53:10.208
[breathes shakily]

962
53:10.292 --> 53:11.584
…I would die.

963
53:20.468 --> 53:23.972
I'll do anything you ask of me. Whatever you need for your script.

964
53:25.390 --> 53:26.599
If you want,

965
53:26.683 --> 53:28.310
I can even be romantic.

966
53:28.393 --> 53:30.103
Dinners, flowers, all that.

967
53:30.937 --> 53:32.230
Come live with me.

968
53:32.814 --> 53:35.442
We'll only touch as much as you're comfortable.

969
53:35.525 --> 53:38.278
I don't need much contact. We can just hold hands.

970
53:38.361 --> 53:41.573
Hang on, wait, wait… Back up. I'm pretty sure you just said…

971
53:42.157 --> 53:43.283
I'm…

972
53:44.534 --> 53:46.911
Did I hear that right? You want me to move in?

973
53:46.995 --> 53:48.830
Yes. Today made things very clear.

974
53:48.913 --> 53:51.249
I won't waste time searching the back alleys of Seoul for you

975
53:51.333 --> 53:52.667
in a life-or-death situation.

976
53:52.751 --> 53:54.836
Imagine if the worst had happened.

977
53:54.919 --> 53:57.714
How exactly am I supposed to recharge without you?

978
53:57.797 --> 53:59.924
Please, Miss Bo-bae.

979
54:00.508 --> 54:01.843
I need you by my side.

980
54:02.635 --> 54:03.720
[Ho-rang sighs]

981
54:04.220 --> 54:05.388
Ah…

982
54:06.056 --> 54:09.351
Hang on, this whole time you were talking about recharging?

983
54:09.434 --> 54:10.352
[watch chimes]

984
54:13.146 --> 54:14.022
[chimes]

985
54:16.024 --> 54:18.276
-[Korean ballad playing] -[Bo-bae gasps]

986
54:19.069 --> 54:19.986
Oh my gosh.

987
54:20.612 --> 54:21.946
This is…

988
54:22.030 --> 54:25.283
It's like an ultimate charge… But only when we touching?

989
54:25.867 --> 54:27.702
Ultimate charge? Yeah.

990
54:29.037 --> 54:30.747
That is a good way to say it.

991
54:31.498 --> 54:34.751
The battery charges faster the more intense the touch is.

992
54:35.502 --> 54:37.379
What? That's impossible. Uh…

993
54:37.462 --> 54:38.380
[gasps]

994
54:39.631 --> 54:41.383
Please save me, Na Bo-bae.

995
54:42.759 --> 54:46.096
-[Korean ballad playing] -Until the surgery. Just for three months.

996
54:47.806 --> 54:49.432
Recharge my heart.

997
54:53.186 --> 54:54.896
[Yeom] You've got three months.

998
54:54.979 --> 54:59.526
Three months to cook up a steamy romance. I'm counting on you.

999
55:08.576 --> 55:09.494
You're on.

1000
55:09.994 --> 55:11.246
I'll do it.

1001
55:13.581 --> 55:15.166
Your heart's safe with me.

1002
55:16.418 --> 55:18.169
[music intensifies]

1003
55:28.179 --> 55:29.722
[watch chimes]

1004
55:30.348 --> 55:34.811
[rhythmic chiming]

1005
55:44.195 --> 55:45.530
[Korean ballad continues]

1006
57:22.293 --> 57:24.462
[music fades out]
